<title>HONG KONG: BZW Asia appoints head of Asian fixed income sales.</title>
<headline>BZW Asia appoints head of Asian fixed income sales.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Asia, the regional arm of Barclays Bank Plc's investment banking division BZW, said on Thursday it appointed Loren Boston as head of its fixed income sales team for Asia.</p>
<p>Based in Hong Kong, Boston will be responsible for a sales force that markets international fixed income products to all Asian countries excluding Japan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
